    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong> About This Game </strong></u></h2><br>&quot;Walpurgis Raid&quot; is an action-packed roughlite game where you'll take charge of the witch and face off against endless hordes of monsters. Strategize your builds, upgrade your heroines, and unleash utter devastation upon your foes. Aid these heroic characters in their quest to claim the ultimate prize\u2014the wish-granting miracle egg.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/8a2b3c55b7262c030a04db26d595887f.poster.avif?t=1702701413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/8a2b3c55b7262c030a04db26d595887f.webm?t=1702701413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong> Choose Your Witch </strong></u></h2><br>Every witch possesses their own unique magical skills. With your support and guidance, they can grow stronger and triumph in the raid. Choose their magical growth wisely and upgrade each witch according to your preferred style, unlocking their true potential and making them even more formidable.<br>Each witch have their own story and their exclusive CG ending<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/ed36311a9aa17c5001c123b56a5b5053.poster.avif?t=1702701413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/ed36311a9aa17c5001c123b56a5b5053.webm?t=1702701413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/ed36311a9aa17c5001c123b56a5b5053.mp4?t=1702701413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong> Bullet Hell Action </strong></u></h2><br>Engage in intense battles against a multitude of enemies to collect valuable souls, a vital resource for upgrading and strengthening your witches. But beware, the threat doesn't only come from dangerous monsters from other dimensions. The witches must also face fierce battles against each other, driven by their covetous desires for the miracle egg. Harness the distinctive abilities of each character, carefully selecting from a wide range of magical spells and abilities. Fight for survival against relentless waves of enemies across diverse and challenging environments. It's the ultimate test of skill and power. Will your witches emerge victorious and claim the prize?<br>Immerse yourself in the world of polished pixel art graphics, breathtaking visual effects (VFX), and seamless performance, even when faced with hundreds of monsters on the screen. Prepare to be captivated by the stunning aesthetics and enjoy a smooth gaming experience that truly brings the game to life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/417d0b8dfb785fca87350710f2e2d7c7.poster.avif?t=1702701413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/417d0b8dfb785fca87350710f2e2d7c7.webm?t=1702701413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/417d0b8dfb785fca87350710f2e2d7c7.mp4?t=1702701413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong> Game Feature </strong></u></h2><br>Vampire Survivors style with the cute anime style witch<br>Exclusive ending for each Witch after clear the story mode<br>Upgrade and combine Spell to make witch stronger<br>The Familiar support to enchange the witch ability<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/643d72ef4ac75af1788b4ba3c7e92f56.poster.avif?t=1702701413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/643d72ef4ac75af1788b4ba3c7e92f56.webm?t=1702701413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444900/extras/643d72ef4ac75af1788b4ba3c7e92f56.mp4?t=1702701413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
